OL,3,ASean 'Diddy' Combs moved to
OL,4,Alow-security facility in Pennsylvania
OL,5,
OL,6,FCombs, 56, who was sentenced to 50
OL,7,Fmonths behind bars, has asked an
OL,8,Fappeals court to release him from
OL,9,Fprison and overturn his conviction on
OL,10,Ftwo prostitution-related crimes.
